 riters'-room experience). Apply via the Jewish Writers Institute screenwri
 ters page.\n\nOrganisation: Jewish Writers Institute\nLocation: United Sta
 tes (in-person seminars in Los Angeles\, New York and Israel)\nAward: $10\
